WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.330
A dream of the past?

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.500
Yeah, the type of dream where you fully relive
a moment from earlier in your life.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.790
I've had a few dreams that involved pieces of my past...

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.580
Yeah, like going to a familiar place
or meeting an old friend.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.620
I can't say I've ever had a dream where
I relived something exactly from memory.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.000
How about you, Sayaka?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.160
I haven't, either.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:29.000
Maybe this is happening because you keep
remembering that moment while you're awake, Touko.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.660
Remembering it?

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:38.330
Right. You're not dreaming of the past, but dreaming
about yourself in the midst of remembering something.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.790
Wow, I don't think I can wrap my head around that.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.200
You might be right...

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:09.330
Komorebi kirakira yureteru asa no

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.200
Namikimichi

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:22.790
Itsumo no kimi no "ohayou" tte koe ga kikoeru

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.500
Kagi o kaketa glass no hako ni

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:34.500
Nani o kakushite irundarou?

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:40.700
Ugokihajimeta monogatari

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:45.370
Kimi no sekai motto shiritakute

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:51.500
Guuzen fureta sono yubi o

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:56.080
Ima nigittanda

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:59.540
Tsuyogari mo yowasa mo

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:06.080
Zenbu tsutsunde ageru yo

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:12.120
Gyutto

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:19.330
Student Council
Stage Show
Title Undecided

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.330
I finished the first draft...

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.870
Then let go and let me see it!

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.750
When you finished your book,
you didn't mind when I looked at it, right?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:32.410
Yeah, but this is my first time writing
a script so it might suck,

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.910
and I'm still not sure how I feel about the ending I chose.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.160
Oh, really?

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:41.290
Then we should ask everyone in the Student Council
to give some feedback, don't you think?

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:44.910
That's what I plan to do! I'll do just that, but...

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.830
Yoink!

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:52.660
All right, I'll go make copies to give to everyone else.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.370
Okay, fine.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.200
Nanami-senpai!

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:05.370
I'm glad I found you before you left!

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.790
What's up?

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.040
The script for the stage show is finished!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:09.950
Really?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.450
Well, technically it's just the first draft.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.660
Let me see!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.200
Huh?

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:27.540
Um, well...

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.910
It sure is hot today, huh?

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:35.200
Actually, I have some more copies.
Could you give one to Saeki-senpai?

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.700
Well, I'm walking home with my friends today, bye.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.580
Okay then... see you tomorrow for Student Council!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.950
Did she just... avoid me?

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.620
I guess I took things a little too far last time.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.200
I need to calm down.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.660
So that she doesn't hate me.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:08.250
Koyomi told me that she was writing
the characters to fit the actors.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.750
Fujishiro
Bookstore

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:15.000
The main character in her script is
a girl who is suffering from amnesia.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:19.120
The story begins at the hospital
where she is being treated.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:24.410
During her stay, she's visited by her lover,
a family member, and a friend.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.540
As they talk about their memories
of the time they've spent with her,

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.500
she gets completely different impressions
of herself from each of them.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:39.580
With no sign of her memory coming back,
she faces a serious problem.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:42.250
Although she wants to return to
the person she once was,

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:47.040
she has no idea which of the people
they talked about is the "true" her.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.250
"Who should I become in order
to continue living my life?"

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:59.000
"I have to become one of them, or else...
I'll have nothing left."

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:03.910
Yuu?

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:08.120
I'm closing up the store, can you take care of the front?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.370
Koyomi really is amazing.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.830
She wrote all that without even
knowing much about Nanami-senpai.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:21.830
Although the main character's situation isn't
that similar to Nanami-senpai's...

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.620
I wonder how she reacted when she finished reading it?

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.700
End

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.290
Kano-san sure is scary.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.660
The role of an empty girl, meant for me...

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:47.500
Please feel free
to write a wish and
hang it from the tree. 
- Student Council

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.500
Nanami-senpai, good morning.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.450
Good morning, Yuu.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.750
Do you think everyone will write their wishes
for the Star Festival here?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.950
Well, that's what we prepared this tree for.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.080
You should write something to hang on it, too.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.950
What did you write, Senpai?

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.160
Do you even need to ask? Just look.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.750
I wish for the
Student Council
stage show
to be a success.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.750
What is your wish?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:12.910
Maybe I should... wish for a good grade
on the upcoming math test.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:18.160
Why waste your wish on that,
when I can just tutor you again?

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:23.790
I mean, only if you don't mind
having me tutor you again...

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.950
Okay, I think I'll take you up on that.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:31.660
We should get going.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.830
Right, see you after school.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:34.620
Yeah.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.290
Oops, I brought the paper with me.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.950
A wish, huh?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:49.200
I'm assuming you all took some time
to look over the script.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:53.410
Today we're going to discuss it,
so I asked Kano-san to join us.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.080
Th-thanks for having me.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:07:01.500
You wrote all the characters with
one of us in mind to play them, right?

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:02.580
Yes.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.870
Although, I noticed you didn't write
any of our names in the script.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:10.160
Um, I wanted you to read it first
without knowing your roles.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.330
Okay, let me just check with you then.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:18.660
For the main character, the girl who has amnesia,
you must have meant her to be played by me, right?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:19.370
Right.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.330
Which means Yuu is probably the nurse
who's in charge of her care.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.750
A minor role!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.250
The girl's younger brother is Maki-kun.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.500
And her classmate must be Dojima-kun?

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:29.870
That's right.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.910
That leaves the role of the girl's lover, who must be...

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.250
...Sayaka, is that right?

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:37.290
Yes.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:42.620
Well, anyone can tell from the way
it was written that her lover was a girl.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.290
Huh?!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.160
Girls dating other girls?

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.290
Dojima didn't read it at all.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:51.870
Well, I thought the person who is closest
with Nanami-senpai would be best,

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:57.120
and you know, some people around school joke
about how the two of you are like a married couple.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.120
So, it was the easiest for me to imagine
Saeki-senpai in the role!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.370
Is that a problem?

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:06.910
I think it's a great idea!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:11.750
Hardly anybody would come see
the show if Maki or I played the role.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:14.700
That's for sure.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.200
What do you think, Touko?

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.120
Huh?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.290
I'm fine with it.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:25.830
I also think Sayaka is the best fit for the role.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.790
If that's what you think, then I'm all for it, but...

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.750
Kano-san really doesn't know anything, right?

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.370
Is there gonna be a kiss scene?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.540
There's not!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.580
Let's add one!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.700
We don't need one!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.620
Hakozaki-sensei.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.870
Sorry to interrupt your meeting.

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.950
About your earlier request,
I think we'll be able to work it out.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.410
Really?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.250
That's great! Thank you very much!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.040
What's up?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.370
What are you talking about?

00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.580
Well, actually...

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.790
...are any of you interested in doing
a study camp for summer break?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.750
A study camp? For the Student Council?

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.370
Yeah, yeah! I'm in!

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.000
Where will it be held?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.290
We have a school lodge for study camps.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.700
I thought we'd stay 2 nights there
rehearsing for the show.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.660
Once the second semester starts other clubs and
classes will have their own rehearsals to do,

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.000
so we discussed taking some time
to do ours over the summer break.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.250
Are you in?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.080
I know you're asking us...

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.500
but we really don't get a choice, do we?

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:35.290
The stage show is finally starting to take shape.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:37.580
That's because we worked for it!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:42.330
I was a little surprised that
the main character's love interest was a girl.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:44.870
Yeah, that threw me for a loop!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:49.830
I definitely think that Saeki-senpai is perfect for the part.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.080
If either of the first-year boys did it,
we'd get buried in complaints!

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.250
Do you not have any complaints, Yuu?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:58.580
Nope, none at all.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:00.660
I figured as much.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:17.540
Want my help?

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:21.750
No, I almost have this one figured out.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.040
Actually, what I'm more worried about is the study camp.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.830
I'm afraid that a certain someone
might make things weird.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.910
I-I won't do anything!

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.250
Even though we'll be together
for three whole days and two nights?

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.790
We'll also be sleeping in the same room together.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.450
I promise I won't do anything!

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:42.540
What exactly can I do with Sayaka
there keeping an eye on us?

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.410
So, you can hold yourself back?

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.000
I'll learn how to...

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:53.250
I've been thinking that I need to hold back more,
not just because of the study camp.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.870
More than anything, I don't want you to hate me.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.370
You don't need to worry about that.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:07.870
Although, I'm glad that you do.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.750
Senpai...

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.750
Touko-senpai...

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.120
I can't call out her name.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.700
I can't be the one who initiates anything.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.660
Even though she does whatever
she wants to me nearly all the time.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.660
Oh, the last two.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.410
Nanami-senpai, which one do you wan-?

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:38.910
The cream one's mine!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.830
That's the one that I wanted!

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:44.750
So yummy!

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:47.750
She is seriously...

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.290
so unfair.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:12:00.000
We'll be doing a study camp with the stage show as
the focus, can you come and watch the rehearsals?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.540
You're a former member, so I think you would
be able to give them good advice, Ichigaiya-kun.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:10.000
No, no. I realize it's only a small part of
the culture festival, but they are really serious about it.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.250
Their script is completely original and pretty interesting.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:17.080
They really want to revive the old Student Council
tradition from seven years ago.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.000
The Student Council's?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:22.120
Oh, I didn't tell you? I'm talking about a stage show
performed by the Student Council.

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:25.410
The lead will be played by the current
council President, a girl named Nanami-san.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.500
When will it be?

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.330
When should I come?

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.750
I wish for
first place
at nationals!

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:33.040
Good morning, Yuu!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.790
Good morning.

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.540
Did you write your wish, yet?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.290
I wasn't able to think of anything good.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:44.410
Really? It's okay to be greedy
every once in a while, you know.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.870
You think so?

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.830
Well, good luck on the tests!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.750
There is something that I want to wish for.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:57.410
But it's stuck so deep inside me
that I can't put it into words.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.660
Even if I did write it...

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.120
...I could never admit to it.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:13.950
The Incomplete Me / Daytime Star

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:19.000
Mirage

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.540
Yuu?

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.830
If you're not busy, come and watch the shop!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:31.120
Just because it's summer vacation doesn't
mean you can laze around all day.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.450
I'm not nearly as bad as Rei-chan is.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.120
Cut me a break! Summer vacation barely just started.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.700
Maybe it's time I asked for a raise...

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:43.000
I can't hear you!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.120
Good grief, she always does that.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:48.580
But...

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:54.080
...with no Student Council work
until the study camp, I'm totally free.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.540
What did I used to do during my summer vacations?

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:02.370
Study Camp

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.750
In middle school I was always
doing stuff with the softball club.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:06.120
Maybe I'll go play with someone, somewhere.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.370
I like our school's uniform,
but it's too hot to wear in the summer.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.290
Senpai hasn't sent me any messages.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.580
The area around the belt
always gets super sweaty, right?
Yes! Exactly!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:11.500
She really must be holding back.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.370
I have to go take my turn in the bath now.
See you at the study camp.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.290
It's hard for me to be the one who reaches out.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.910
I'm letting Nanami-senpai control too much of my life.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.950
I can enjoy my vacation plenty
without her being a part of it!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:25.950
For now, I'll...

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.950
...wake up early and get moving!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:32.750
Natsuki!

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:34.660
Yuu!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.790
I haven't seen you since Golden Week.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.950
Yeah, it's been a while!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.160
So, how's the Student Council? Enjoying it?

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.910
More or less, we've even got a study camp next week.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.250
A study camp?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.330
What for?

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.290
We're putting on a stage show at the Culture Festival,
so the camp will be for rehearsal.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:56.830
Our council president is going
to be playing the lead role.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.950
But why is the Student Council doing it?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.750
Everybody always asks that.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:05.120
Hold on, Natsuki. Why is your pace so fast?

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.620
You've lost your touch, Yuu.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.410
Back when we were on the team,
this would have been a piece of cake!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:15.200
Actually, I've got a training camp with
the softball team coming up, too.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.080
It's our new team's first outing together!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.080
I've gotta start getting ready.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.950
I need to go shopping for supplies, too.

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:24.500
Are you free today?

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.200
Yeah. Let's go!

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.370
Did you just wake up now?!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.790
Yeah, my shift at work doesn't start until this evening.

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:35.000
Where's Yuu?

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.950
Shopping. She said she was borrowing your sandals.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.620
And you just let her?

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.120
Did she go with someone?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.750
I think she said she was going with Natsuki-chan.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:47.450
So, she's not with Nanami-chan?

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.700
Her senpai from the Student Council?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.620
I'm sure she's too busy to be playing
with Yuu over the break.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:55.120
I don't think that's true at all.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.700
Jeez, how dull!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:06.000
I wonder which is better for bedtime,
a jersey or pajamas?

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:09.330
Does it really matter?
You're just going to be sleeping, anyway.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:14.540
I'd prefer to wear something cute,
but I also don't want to seem like I'm trying too hard.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:15.910
Are you done yet?

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.120
You're taking forever, Yuu!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.450
You go to cafes like this?

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:26.330
I came here with my senpai once
and ever since then I stop by sometimes.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:27.620
Welcome.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:28.540
Hello.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.450
You seem really friendly
with this Nanami-senpai of yours.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:33.830
It's nothing special.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:35.000
Oh really?

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.750
You've been talking a lot about the Student Council,
but "Nanami-senpai" is the only name you've mentioned.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:45.040
That's mostly because I have to pay attention to her
all the time, or else she takes advantage of me.

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.910
She's super selfish all the time...

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:55.700
First the elections and now this stage show,
everything was her doing.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:17:00.700
She's really smart, but never gives much
consideration to how I feel about anything.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.290
Huh? What?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:11.910
It's the first time I've seen you get invested
in something enough to start complaining about it!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.250
You've sure changed.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.200
Huh?!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:19.950
I've always thought you had an extraordinarily
high tolerance for everything in life, Yuu.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:23.660
Back when we were in the softball club,
we really put our heart into every match

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:26.500
but win or lose, you were the only one
who never got frustrated enough to cry.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.330
Oh! I'm not trying to insult you or anything.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.580
Yeah, I know.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:36.450
So, hey.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:37.660
Huh?

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:42.620
I think it's okay to confess now,
but I always considered inviting you

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.200
to join me at a high school where
we could play softball together again.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.080
I decided against it, though.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:49.160
Huh? Why?

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:53.250
Because I knew that if I did, you would actually do it.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:56.750
And I thought that might not be the right thing for you.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:02.330
I'm sorry to say it, but it makes me happy
to hear you've got your hands full now.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.330
Huh?

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:08.410
I've always wanted to see what you looked like
when you were totally invested in something!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.040
You're weird.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:16.660
I'm a little disappointed that
something wasn't softball, though.

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.580
You have a new message.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.830
Changes in update version 7.10.1

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.160
So, are you going to be making the food
for the study camp yourselves?

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:34.450
That's right. I wonder what we should make?

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:39.700
How about curry? It's easy to make a lot of it,
and you can have the leftovers the next day!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.370
But that's what everybody does!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:42.910
Touko.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.830
You don't have to force yourself to do this.

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:48.080
Do what?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.540
The Student Council stage show is-

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.700
I'm fine.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.000
Thanks for dinner.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.200
I'm doing this because it's what I want to do,

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.120
and yet he's still saying stuff like that?

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:13.790
See you at the study camp
Okay. Make sure you do
your summer homework
Ugh...

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:13.790
Goodnight, Yuu
Good night
Hey, are you there?

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.160
See you at the study camp
Okay. Make sure you do
your summer homework
Ugh...
Goodnight, Yuu
Good night

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.120
Hold back.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.660
It's so hard to do.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.330
Yuu Koito
Email          Call        Message

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.580
Yuu Koito

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:35.580
Yuu Koito

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.330
Hello? Senpai?

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.370
Yuu? Good evening!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.410
Um, do you have some time to talk?

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.540
Yeah, did something happen?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:55.160
No, nothing. I just wanted to hear your voice...

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.120
What did you do today?

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:02.580
Today I went out with an old friend
of mine from middle school.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:04.620
I bought some supplies for the study camp.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:06.790
What did you buy?

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.620
Nothing remarkable.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.500
Just tell me!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.500
It doesn't really matter, does it?

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.410
What did you do today, Senpai?

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.250
You're avoiding the subject.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.830
I'm not avoiding anything!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.200
It's unfair if I just talked about myself
the whole time, right?

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:22.450
You're right.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.290
Well, today I went out with a small group to surprise
a friend who works at a nearby family restaurant.

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:26.160
Talking with Yuu calms me down.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:29.500
Her curt replies to our trivial conversations.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.410
We showed up without a reservation.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.250
Whoa, that's so mean.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.540
Her very mundane reactions.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.370
It wasn't mean! We were there as customers,

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:39.410
No matter what's going on with me,
I know that deep down, Yuu doesn't really care.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:39.000
although we only ordered stuff that's difficult to pronounce.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.200
That is beyond cruel.

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:44.370
The irritation I felt earlier is already gone,
it just slips away.

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:45.250
You think so? We paid full price for everything,
and I'm sure it's not the first time she dealt with it.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.660
Hey Yuu, are you actually listening to me?

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.250
I'm listening. Why do you ask?

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:54.250
It's just, your voice makes you seem really indifferent.

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:57.500
You're just imagining it.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.790
Talking with her always makes me feel anxious.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.790
So, what happened after that?

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:01.950
It's exactly like Natsuki said.
My hands are full dealing with her.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.950
But, I actually kind of like it.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.370
I told you already, I'm listening!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.830
Jeez, if I was indifferent, I would have hung up already!

